  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jabbii Warqee Irraa Hojjetame",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sabni sunis yommuu akka Museen tulluu irra ture argetti Aroonin marsee, \"Musee namicha biyya Gibxiitii baasee nu fide sana waan inni taʼe hin beeknuutii kaʼii waaqota nu dura deeman nuu tolchi\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroon immoo, \"Warqee gurraa kan niitonni keessan, ilmaan keessanii fi intallan keessan keeyyatan irraa baasaatii natti fidaa\" jedhee deebiseef.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namoonni hundinuu warqee gurra isaanii of irraa baasanii Aroonitti fidan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis warqee sana isaan harkaa fuudhee miʼa ittiin hojjetaniin baqsee Waaqa tolfamaa bifa jabbiitiin hojjetame tokko tolche; isaanis, \"Yaa Israaʼel isaan kunneen waaqota kee warra biyya Gibxiitii si baasanii dha\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroonis yommuu waan kana argetti fuula jabbii sanaa duratti iddoo aarsaa ijaaree, \"Bori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayyaanni ni ayyaaneffama\" jedhee labse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis guyyaa itti aanu ganama bariin kaʼanii, aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessanii aarsaa nagaas fidan. Kana irratti nyaachuu fi dhuguuf tataaʼan; sirbuufis kaʼan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museedhaan akkana jedhe; \"Sabni kee kan ati biyya Gibxiitii baaftee fidde sun xuraaʼeeraatii gad buʼi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaan dafanii karaa ani isaan ajaje irraa jalʼataniiru; Waaqa tolfamaa bifa jabbiitiin baqfamee qopheeffame illee ofii isaaniitiif tolfatanii aarsaa dhiʼeessaniifii, 'Yaa Israaʼel isaan kunneen waaqota kee warra biyya Gibxiitii si baasanii dha' jedhanii isa waaqeffataniiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museedhaan akkana jedhe; 'Kunoo, ani akka sabni kun mata jabeessa taʼe argeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu akka aariin koo isaanitti bobaʼuu fi akka ani isaan balleessuuf na dhiisi. Yommus ani saba guddaa si taasisa.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museen garuu fuula gargaarsa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqa isaa barbaaddate; akkanas jedhe; \"Yaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", dheekkamsi kee maaliif saba kee warra ati humna guddaa fi irree jabaadhaan biyya Gibxiitii baafte sanatti bobaʼa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Warri Gibxii maaliif, 'Inni duruma iyyuu yaada hamaadhaan tulluuwwan irratti isaan fixuu fi lafa irraa isaan balleessuuf Gibxii isaan baasee?' jedhu. Aarii kee bobaʼaa sana irraa deebiʼi; obsis; saba keettis badiisa hin fidin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garboota kee Abrahaam, Yisihaaqii fi Israaʼelin warra, 'Ani sanyii kee akka urjiiwwan samii irraa nan baayʼisa; lafa ani waadaa isaaniif seene kana hundas sanyii keessaniif nan kenna; isaanis bara baraan lafa sana ni dhaalu' jettee maqaa keetiin kakatteef sana yaadadhu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kana irratti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaada geeddaratee badiisa saba isaatti fiduuf ture sana dhiise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museenis gabateewwan kakuu lamaan sana harkatti qabatee deebiʼee tulluu irraa gad buʼe. Gabatee sana irrattis karaa lachuu, duraa duubaan barreeffamee ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabateewwan sanas Waaqatu hojjete; katabbiin sunis katabbii Waaqaa kan gabateewwan sana irratti soofamee barreeffamee dha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyyaasuunis yommuu waca namootaa dhagaʼetti Museedhaan, \"Iddoo buufataa keessa sagalee waraanaatu jira\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museen immoo akkana jedhee deebise:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EXO 32:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Sagaleen ani dhagaʼu kun",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EXO 32:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "sagalee sirbaati malee sagalee mooʼuu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EXO 32:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "yookaan sagalee moʼatamuu miti.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museenis akkuma iddoo qubataatti dhiʼaatee jabbii fi shuubbisa sana argeen aaree gubate; gabateewwan sana harka isaa irraa darbatee tulluu sana jalatti caccabse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis jabbii jarri tolchan sana fuudhee ibiddaan gube; daakee bulleessees bishaanitti firfirsee Israaʼeloota obaase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museenis Arooniin, \"Sabni kun maal si goonaan ati cubbuu guddaa akkasii keessa isaan buufte?\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroon immoo deebisee akkana jedhe; \"Yaa gooftaa ko, aartee hin gubatin; akka sabni kun gara hamminaatti jalʼatu atuu beekta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaan, 'Musee namicha Gibxii baasee nu fide sana waan inni taʼe hin beeknuutii waaqota nu dura deeman nuu tolchi' naan jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anis, 'Namni warqee qabu of irraa haa baasu' jedheen; isaanis warqee sana natti kennan; anis ibidda keessa nan buuse; inni immoo jabbii taʼee baʼe!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museen akka sabni sun gad dhiisiitti jiraate, Aroonis akka isaan toʼannaadhaan ala taʼan akka godhee fi akka isaan diinota isaanii birattis waan kolfaa taʼan arge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu Museen karra qubataa dura dhaabatee, \"Mee warri gara",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gortan hundi gara koo kottaa\" jedhe. Lewwonni hundis isa biratti walitti qabaman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ergasii inni akkana isaaniin jedhe; \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqni Israaʼel akkana jedha; 'Tokkoon tokkoon namaa mudhii isaatti goraadee haa hidhatu; tokkoon tokkoon namaas qubata sana keessa karra tokko irraa gara karra kaaniitti asii fi achi deemee obboloota isaa, michoota isaatii fi ollaa isaa haa ajjeesu.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lewwonnis akkuma Museen isaan ajaje godhan; guyyaa sana saba sana keessaa nama gara kuma sadiitu duʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museenis, \"Isin waan ilmaan keessanii fi obboloota keessanitti kaataniif harʼa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "addaan baafamtaniirtu; innis guyyaa harʼaa isin eebbiseera\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museen guyyaa itti aanutti saba sanaan, \"Isin cubbuu guddaa hojjettaniirtu. Garuu ani amma gara",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyootti",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ol nan baʼa; tarii ani cubbuu keessaniif araara nan buusa taʼa\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Museenis deebiʼee gara",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyoo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dhaqee akkana jedhe; \"Wayyoo! Sabni kun cubbuu akkam guddaa hojjete! Isaan ofii isaaniitiif waaqota warqee tolfataniiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taʼus maaloo amma cubbuu isaanii dhiisiif; yoo kanaa achi kitaaba barreessite sana keessaa maqaa koo haqi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "immoo Museedhaan akkana jedhe; \"Ani nama cubbuu natti hojjete kitaaba koo irraa nan haqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma kaʼiitii gara lafa ani sitti hime sanaatti saba kana qajeelchi; kunoo ergamaan koos fuula kee dura ni deema. Garuu gaafa yeroon ani isaan adabu gaʼutti ani cubbuu isaaniitiif isaan nan adaba.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sababii balleessaa isaan jabbii Aroon tolche sanaan hojjetaniitiif",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Waaqayyo",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.32.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.32.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balaadhaan saba sana dhaʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
